=== optional_filters_are_option_parameters-1 call
--- source
query search (name: Option Text, after: Option Instant) -> Set Post =
               from p in posts
               where match name  | None -> true | Some { value: n } -> p.title == n
               where match after | None -> true | Some { value: t } -> p.created_at > t
               select p
--- args
Option Text|Some { value: "again" }
Option Instant|None
--- shape
set
--- type
Post
--- expected
Post { id: posts.key(2), author: users.key(1), created_at: 1970-01-01T00:00:00.000020Z, title: "again" }
